  message: "Fixed in PR #1792 (dev 646557ef77). Root cause: a nested function's body is a may-run region at its definition (WI-faful), so reaching definitions never connected a definition placed AFTER it. cfg.late_capture_edges adds an edge from each such definition to each read of the name in the nested function, except reads after the nested function's own binding of the name. Repro re-run on merged dev with the shipped CLI (verify-claims, claim host_secret -> network, the filed app.js): exit 1, SECRET-NET verdict=violated, evidence [(ddg, confirmed)]; before: confirmed, no evidence. Corpus 10 repos (flask-restful, gin, coredns, Tone.js, fastapi, buildah, dash.js, django, spring-petclinic, ripgrep): 0 verdicts, 0 evidence tuples moved; 1 of 3566 walk results None->True (buildah RemoveImages; real flow through appendError, checked by hand). Known over-approximation left: a nested function's PARAMETERS are not counted as its own binding. Record: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_10212026_nilir.md."  # 0cc0
